                Why <span class="text-t-green" >AI-Powered</span> Padel<br class="hidden sm:block lg:hidden" /> ball machines stand out  
              </h2>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                Traditional padel machines can fire balls at set speeds and intervals, but that’s where their capabilities stop. They’re great for repetition, but not for replicating the unpredictable pace and angles of a real match.
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                The Tennibot Partner changes that. Driven by AI, it doesn’t just shoot balls. It thinks. It adjusts shot patterns based on your training goals, feeding balls with customized speed, spin, and placement. Whether you're working on volleys off the glass or defending from the back wall, the Partner delivers drills that actually feel like match play.
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                No need for a hitting partner. No wasted time. Just smarter sessions that push your game forward.
              </p>

              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                With advanced drill programming and real-time shot precision, the Tennibot Partner helps you train with intent and intensity. More quality reps. More tactical awareness. Faster improvement.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="h-[50vh] md:h-[60vh] lg:h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
